          "japanese": "場面"
        },
        {
          "english": "On weekdays, breakfast is usually ready at seven. You can help yourself to cereal, toast or fruit. If you leave early, please tell us the night before. Dinner is normally at six thirty, but on Fridays we sometimes eat later. You do not need to wash the dishes every day. We take turns. If you are not sure about anything, just ask.",
