          "english": "授業",
          "japanese": "場面"
        },
        {
          "english": "Today we are going to compare two ways of travelling to university. First, work in pairs and list the advantages of each option. Then choose one option and explain your reasons to the class. You have ten minutes for the discussion. Remember to give at least one example. At the end, write a short paragraph about your choice and hand it in before you leave.",
